    "title": "A Search for the Decay Modes $B^{\\pm} \\to h^{\\pm} \\tau^{\\mp} \\ell^{\\pm}$",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/1204.2852v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1204.2852)",
